      "title": "Opposites",
      "teach": "Say how the first two words go together, then find the word that goes with the third the same way. {a} and {b} are opposites, so {c} goes with {answer}.",
      "prompt": "{a} is to {b} as {c} is to …?",
      "reason": "They go together the same way.",
      "reasons": {
